{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>A psalm, a song for the Sabbath day</b> — He did not mention the name of the poet." "And the sense of <b>for the Sabbath day</b> — that they would sing this psalm on it, and the witness that comes after it —"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 92, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:58.524183907Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}